---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Contact" description="Contact VolnLabs about an Actryn pilot, investment, test access or technical review.">
  <div class="min">
    <main id="main-content">
      <h1>Work with us<span class="accent">.</span></h1>
      <p class="lead">We are looking for one bounded robot workflow that can be qualified end to end with a partner.</p>

      <h2>Good reasons to reach out</h2>
      <ul class="rule-list">
        <li><strong>Pilot</strong><p>You build or integrate inspection robots and have one controller and workflow to evaluate.</p></li>
        <li><strong>Test access</strong><p>You can provide bench access, a controller or supervised field time for physical qualification.</p></li>
        <li><strong>Technical review</strong><p>You work in controls, functional safety or cybersecurity and can review the pilot design.</p></li>
        <li><strong>Investment</strong><p>You want to discuss funding the first reproducible physical deployment and an integration hire.</p></li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Email is best for context. Use the calendar when a short first conversation is easier.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a href="mailto:utkarsh@volnlabs.com">utkarsh@volnlabs.com</a>
        <a href="https://cal.com/utkarsh-maurya/axiomos" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="secondary">Book a call</a>
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>
</Base>
